      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a rocket launch with text humorously comparing the 'Challenger' sex position to the space shuttle Challenger, which famously exploded during launch. The text states 'i go hard for 73 seconds then prematurely blow,' implying a short-lived sexual performance. The overall intent is to use the visual of a powerful, high-stakes launch to create a comedic analogy for a sexual act that is intense but brief. The meme is not targeting any specific group or protected characteristic and does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda content. The humor is self-deprecating and relies on the juxtaposition of the grandeur of space exploration with a mundane, personal experience. The intent is to elicit laughter through absurd comparison and relatable self-ridicule.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5ef564e8"
